# #5833. The WAL shard evicts the leaf's foreign-high entry without raising its eviction
# floor, so foreignHigh forgets another activation's append made before the eviction.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestEvictionDropsForeignHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an evicted foreign-high entry leaves no floor
PERTURBS: Evict
BOUNDS: WithRestart = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0

--- FIND
    /\ evFloor' = Max({evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \cup LeafAttributed})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no eviction floor.
    /\ UNCHANGED evFloor
--- END
